{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "036c820b-9fcd-8d22-ad60-0ef17f1ed677",
  "created_at": "2026-02-11T14:13:53-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Moira Lynch",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T14:11:32-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T14:11:35-05:00",
      "duration": 25,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, Denise, yes, hello. I'm on speakerphone, I hope you can hear me, I've got my hands full. So, I'm calling for my mother, she's in her eighties and she doesn't do the phone much anymore, and she's been after me about this for, oh, three weeks now. They dug up the road back in the fall for some utility work, the trench, and they patched it, and now it's settled."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T14:12:00-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so the patch sank down?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T14:12:03-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, it left a dip. A real dip, like a bathtub. And it's right in the bike lane, which is the thing, because cyclists swerve out into the car lane to miss it, and then my mother's pulling out of her driveway and [inaudible] there's somebody coming at her."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T14:12:20-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sorry, you broke up a little there. Somebody swerving into the lane?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T14:12:25-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, swerving out around it. Anyway. It's at 454 Callender Avenue, in front of her place, North End."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T14:12:32-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "454 Callender, got it. And it's the utility trench that sank, in the bike lane, in front of the house."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T14:12:40-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Exactly. Not a pothole exactly, more of a sunken strip, maybe six feet long."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T14:12:46-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine, I'll put it in as a trench settlement. Same crew handles it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T14:12:52-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. So how long do these repairs usually take? Because I'd like to tell her something. She's going to ask me tonight, and honestly it's my birthday, so I'd rather not spend dinner on road talk."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T14:13:05-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, happy birthday. For a patch like this, once it's logged it's usually a matter of a couple of weeks, sometimes sooner. Winter slows it down because the asphalt plants are limited and the crews are on cold patch, so it may get a temporary fill first."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T14:13:21-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A couple of weeks. Okay. Fine. That's better than the fall, anyway."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T14:13:26-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Do you want a call back when it's scheduled? I have a number I can use if you give it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T14:13:34-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, it's 401-555-0154."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T14:13:36-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0154, perfect. I've got you down under Moira?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T14:13:40-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Moira Lynch, yes. L-Y-N-C-H."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T14:13:42-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. Somebody will be in touch once a crew is lined up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T14:13:47-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, Denise. I appreciate it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T14:13:50-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Enjoy the rest of your birthday."
    }
  ],
